# TripWise deployment environment template - NAMES AND EXPLANATIONS ONLY.
#
#   cp deploy/.env.example deploy/.env      # deploy/.env is gitignored
#
# Nothing here is required to start the sample-mode stack: with no file at all the stack
# runs with every live provider disabled. Never commit a filled-in copy. Values in this
# file are placeholders; real secrets belong in your secret manager or a gitignored .env.
# Startup validation (python -m api.runtime_config) reports problems by variable NAME
# only and never prints a value.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Required production configuration (set by compose.yaml itself)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# TRIPWISE_ENV=production        'production' enables strict startup validation; compose sets it.
# TRIPWISE_DATA_DIR=/data        Absolute, writable directory for ALL mutable state
#                                (tripwise.sqlite, accounts.sqlite, traces/). Compose mounts the
#                                named volume 'tripwise-data' here.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Compose-level settings (read by `docker compose`, not by the application)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# TRIPWISE_HTTP_PORT=8080            Host loopback port for the reverse proxy.
# TRIPWISE_FRONTEND_API_MODE=live    Frontend build mode: 'live' = real backend, 'mock' = MSW
#                                    fixtures (a build-time choice; rebuild to change it).
# TRIPWISE_CATALOGS_DIR=             Only for deploy/compose.catalogs.yaml: absolute path of the
#                                    directory holding the untracked active_*-core.json catalogs.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Optional application configuration
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# TRIPWISE_CORS_ORIGINS=https://app.example   Comma-separated http(s) origins allowed to call the API
#                                    cross-origin. Leave UNSET for the supported same-origin proxy
#                                    arrangement (production then allows no cross-origin access).
# TRIPWISE_LLM_MAX_CALLS=25          Per-request ceiling on hosted-LLM calls (positive integer).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. Optional local-development only (outside containers)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# See backend/.env.example for the hosted free-tier LLM variables. They are not needed for
# sample mode; without them LLM-backed planning fails honestly instead of guessing.
# TRIPWISE_LLM_BASE_URL / TRIPWISE_LLM_MODEL / TRIPWISE_LLM_API_KEY   Hosted free-tier endpoint.
# TRIPWISE_LLM_FALLBACK_MODELS=a,b    Ordered fallbacks after a model-not-found (same endpoint).
# TRIPWISE_LLM_MODELS=a,b             Alternative: one ordered list instead of MODEL + FALLBACK.
# TRIPWISE_LLM_JSON_MODE=1            Set 0 if the provider rejects response_format=json_object.
# TRIPWISE_OLLAMA_BASE_URL / TRIPWISE_OLLAMA_MODEL   Local Ollama client (development only).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. Live-provider variables - ALL DISABLED BY DEFAULT, and refused in production
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# D1 is a sample-mode profile. Setting any enable flag below in production makes startup
# fail with the variable name. They exist so the documented kill switches are visible.
# TRIPWISE_GONDOLA_LIVE_ENABLED=     Gondola read-only MCP (also needs an interactive OAuth sign-in
#                                    held in the OS keychain - not available in a container).
# TRIPWISE_OPEN_METEO_ENABLED=       Open-Meteo weather-context adapter (needs a separately
#                                    provisioned pinned MCP server and Node >= 24).
# TRIPWISE_TRIPADVISOR_API_KEY=      Tripadvisor Terra credential; live transport is not wired.
# TRIPWISE_INTERVIEW_LLM_ZERO_SPEND_CONFIRMED=   Must be exactly 1 to allow the CP3 interview role.
# TRIPWISE_INTERVIEW_LLM_MODEL= / TRIPWISE_INTERVIEW_LLM_COST_MICRO_USD=0   CP3 interview role model and
#                                    declared cost (must be 0); only read when the line above is 1.
# TRIPWISE_GONDOLA_LIVE_SMOKE=       Developer-only gate for backend/scripts/smoke_gondola.py (a
#                                    human-supervised live call). Never set in a deployment.
# TRIPWISE_OPEN_METEO_PROBE_ACK=     Developer-only acknowledgement for the one-off Open-Meteo probe
#                                    script (gateway/weather/scripts/probe_live.py). Never set in a deployment.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 6. Kill switches - each ALWAYS wins over its enable flag
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# TRIPWISE_GONDOLA_KILL_SWITCH=1
# TRIPWISE_OPEN_METEO_KILL_SWITCH=1
# TRIPWISE_TRIPADVISOR_KILL_SWITCH=1
